From: yaegerbomb42 <yaeger.james42@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:38:41 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(board): add per-agent stats to GET swarm-board

GET /api/mcp/swarm-board now includes an agents map ({name: {claimed,
inReview, completed, rejected}}). review_and_merge_task records the worker's
name on the task's new rejectedBy list when approved=false (immutable append),
so rejections survive re-claims; computeAgentStats derives the buckets from task
status/claimedBy plus tracked rejections. Unit tests cover the pure function,
rejection recording/append, approval, and the GET route's agents payload.

Rebuilt fresh on origin/main (the earlier branch was 50 behind main) to avoid
rebasing drift.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
